Inserts Pn lines at the cursor. If fewer than Pn lines remain from the
current line to the end of the scroll region, the number of lines
inserted is the lesser number. Lines within the scroll region at the end
below the cursor move down. Lines moved past the bottom margin are lost.
The cursor is reset to the first column. This sequence is ignored when
the cursor is outside the scrolling region.
